More labs are expected to publish internal research runs similar to open AI's 10 proofs effort as the cost of long horizon model use continues to drop.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:12.820
Additional open weight mixture of experts releases from AMD and others will likely include full training artifacts.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:21.740
Agent evaluation frameworks like SupaBase evals are likely to expand to more real world task domains beyond database work.

